  abstract={This paper proposes a high-power-density 150 GHz phased-array transceiver designed for 6G user equipment (UE) modules, utilizing $65-\text{nm}$ CMOS technology. An 8 -element AiP module using two transceiver ICs operates in the 142-164 GHz frequency range, achieving an EIRP of 26 dBm and a maximum data rate of 56 Gbps. The power consumption per element is 150 mW in TX mode and 93 mW in RX mode.},
